OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAWWI soldier identified after more
OL,4,Athan a century
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow, that man has been named as Cpl
OL,7,FGeorge Lloyd, who was born in Ludlow,
OL,8,Fand he has a new headstone showing his
OL,9,Fidentity for the first time in more
OL,10,Fthan a century.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
